  "content": "\n\n<p><span><span><iframe src=\"https://www.youtube.com/embed/lBttjKx9eqg?si=QdGEHOwtj0IR4Noi\" width=\"860\" height=\"515\" frameborder=\"0\" allowfullscreen=\"allowfullscreen\"></iframe></span></span></p>\n<p><em>Immersive Messages</em> 是一个面向模组开发者与整合包制作者的 API，可借助字幕直接在玩家屏幕上渲染信息，从而将内容直观地传达给玩家！</p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1109713/description_29564af2-0c0c-454c-856b-b8d91a984413.png\"></p>\n<p style=\"text-align:center\">&nbsp;<strong><a href=\"https://discord.gg/nRQKp3Thsz\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/790272037578473512?label=Luna Pixel&color=393939&labelColor=0843bf&style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://discord.gg/kS7auUeYmc\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/discord/901654795100749884?style=for-the-badge&logo=discord&logoColor=white&label=Txni&labelColor=36633c&color=393939\" alt=\"\"></a> <a href=\"https://github.com/txnimc/ImmersiveMessages\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Github&color=393939&labelColor=666666&style=for-the-badge&logo=Github&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a> <a href=\"https://www.curseforge.com/members/txni/projects\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=CurseForge&color=393939&labelColor=fb594a&style=for-the-badge&logo=CurseForge&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a> <a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fuser%252fTxni\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\"><img src=\"https://img.shields.io/static/v1?label=&message=Modrinth&color=393939&labelColor=33de61&style=for-the-badge&logo=Modrinth&logoColor=white\" alt=\"!&lt;a href=\"></a></strong></p>\n<p><img style=\"display:block;margin-left:auto;margin-right:auto\" src=\"https://media.forgecdn.net/attachments/description/1109713/description_2bb354d4-04f1-4fd2-8617-230985cc5516.png\"></p>\n<p>本模组与自定义字体渲染&nbsp;<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fmodrinth.com%252fmod%252fcaxton\" rel=\"nofollow\">Caxton</a> 集成（注：该模组尚未上架 CurseForge，如需使用精美字体请手动下载！），为整合包制作者和模组开发者提供了一套系统，以便为玩家打造风格化且沉浸式的体验。</p>\n<p>本模组还内置了动画系统，支持过渡效果、文字抖动与摇摆等特效，并可完全控制屏幕上所有文字的大小、颜色与位置。所有消息均可通过模组直接 API 发送，或者非开发者可通过内置的 Minecraft 默认指令<code> /immersivemessages</code> 从服务器向客户端进行网络传输。</p>\n<p>具体用途由你决定！请观看上方的展示视频，了解它能实现哪些效果。</p>\n<h2>面向开发者</h2>\n<p>你可以在以下地址查阅文档：<a href=\"/linkout?remoteUrl=https%253a%252f%252fimmersive.txni.dev%252f\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"nofollow\">https://immersive.txni.dev/</a></p>",
